sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Web Client
    participant API as Spring Boot
    participant S3 as S3 / CloudFront
    participant AI as OpenAI<br/>gpt-image-2
    participant Q as SQS FIFO
    participant W as AI Server

    Note over C,API: 1. 생성 작업 시작
    C->>API: POST /creations
    API-->>C: 201 { creationId }

    Note over C,S3: 2. 원본 사진 업로드
    C->>API: POST /files/presigned-upload<br/>{ creationId, purpose: ORIGINAL_IMAGE, contentType }
    API-->>C: 201 { uploadUrl, key, fileUrl }
    C->>S3: PUT uploadUrl (원본 이미지)

    Note over C,AI: 3. AI 스타일 변환 (동기, 수십 초)
    C->>API: POST /creations/{creationId}/stylized-images<br/>{ originalImageKey, prompt? }
    API->>S3: 원본 이미지 다운로드
    API->>AI: POST /images/edits (multipart)
    AI-->>API: b64 PNG
    API->>S3: 스타일 이미지 업로드
    API-->>C: 200 { stylizedImageUrl }

    Note over C,W: 4. 3D 모델 생성 요청 (비동기)
    C->>API: POST /creations/{creationId}/models<br/>{ productType, size, amount, material, color }
    API->>API: Job 저장 (PENDING)
    API->>Q: enqueue JobMessage<br/>(messageGroupId="job", dedupId=jobId)
    API-->>C: 201 { jobId }

    W->>Q: long polling
    Q-->>W: JobMessage
    W->>S3: GET stylizedImageUrl

    loop 상태 폴링
        C->>API: GET /creations/{creationId}/models/{jobId}
        API-->>C: 200 { status: PENDING }
    end

    Note over W,API: 5. 결과 콜백
    W->>W: image → STL 생성
    W->>S3: STL 업로드
    W->>API: POST /creations/{creationId}/models/{jobId}/result<br/>{ status, modelKey, volumeMm3, bbox…, expectedFee }
    API->>API: Job / Creation 완료 처리
    API-->>W: 200

    C->>API: GET /creations/{creationId}/models/{jobId}
    API-->>C: 200 { status: COMPLETED, modelUrl, geometry, expectedFee }
